==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|head=[[telephone]] [[call]]}}

# A [[connection]] established over a telephone [[network]] between two [[party|parties]].
# The [[conversation]] held by the two parties on this connection.

====Synonyms====
* (''conversation''): [[call]], [[phone call]], [[telephone conversation]] (''formal, used especially in business contexts'')

